<title>FRANCE: Montpellier 1996 air cargo traffic up 19.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Montpellier 1996 air cargo traffic up 19.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo traffic handled at Montpellier airport last year totalled 5,727 tonnes, up 19.5 percent on 1995, airport authority figures show.</p>
<p>Postal traffic handled at Montpellier airport fell by seven percent on the previous year's levels to 4,319 tonnes.</p>
<p>Last year, Montpellier was added to French express distribution operator, Jet Services' overnight air cargo network which operates BAe 146 QC (quick change) aircraft. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
